#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmremotecontrol.cpp:55
msgid ""
"<h1>Remote Controls</h1>"
"<p>This module allows you to configure bindings between your remote controls and KDE applications. Simply select your remote control and click Add next to the Actions/Buttons list to create new action for button presses.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Feernbedeners</h1>"
"<p>Mit dit Moduul kannst Du Toornen twischen Dien Feernbedenen un KDE-Programmen fastleggen. Söök Di eenfach Dien Feernbedenen ut un klick op \"Tofögen\" neegst de Akschonen-/Knööplist, wenn Du en Knoop en nieg Akschoon tofögen wullt.</p>"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kcmremotecontrol.cpp:246
